---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { company, formattedAddress } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms and Conditions governing the use of the Quality Shipping Services Pvt. Ltd. website."
  updated="[Date to be confirmed]"
>
  <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing or using this website, operated by {company.legalName} (“we”, “us”, “our”), you agree to be bound by
    these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Purpose of the Website</h2>
  <p>
    This website provides general information about our freight forwarding and logistics services. It does not
    constitute an offer, quotation or contract. Any quotation or service agreement will be provided separately and will
    be subject to its own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Enquiries and Quotations</h2>
  <p>
    Information submitted through the website's enquiry or contact forms is used to respond to your request. Submission
    of an enquiry does not create a booking or a binding commitment by either party. Rates, transit times and service
    availability are indicative until confirmed in writing.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Freight Forwarding Services</h2>
  <p>
    Freight forwarding services are provided under separate written terms, applicable carrier conditions of carriage and
    international conventions as relevant. Nothing on this website modifies those terms.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Accuracy of Information</h2>
  <p>
    We make reasonable efforts to keep the content of this website accurate and up to date, but we do not warrant that it
    is complete, accurate or free from error. References to ports, airports and trade lanes are for general information
    and do not imply that we operate facilities at those locations.
  </p>

